PN,30201
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to hold cross-party talks on
OL,4,Cfixing crisis in adult social care
OL,6,FAndy Burnham will hold a cross-party
OL,7,Fmeeting to discuss tackling the crisis
OL,8,Fin adult social care, as he pledged to
OL,9,F"put everything I've got" into fixing
OL,10,Fthe system.
OL,12,FBoth the Conservatives and the Liberal
OL,13,FDemocrats accepted the Prime
OL,14,FMinister's invitation "to build that
OL,15,Fspirit of collaboration from the
OL,16,Fstart", however, Nigel Farage hit out
OL,17,Fat Mr Burnham for ignoring Reform UK.
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@YO]vD@WOUxD@FO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to hold cross-party talks on
OL,4,Cfixing crisis in adult social care
OL,6,FMr Burnham said governments have, for
OL,7,Fdecades, failed to tackle reform of
OL,8,Fsocial care in England, seeing it as
OL,9,F"too risky, too difficult, and too
OL,10,Fcomplicated".
OL,12,FTory leader Kemi Badenoch has already
OL,13,Fwritten to Mr Burnham to challenge him
OL,14,Fto rule out tax rises or increased
OL,15,Fborrowing to pay for social care
OL,16,Freform.
OL,18,FShe is unable to attend the meeting, a
OL,19,FTory spokesman said, however, shadow
OL,20,Fhealth secretary Stuart Andrew will go
OL,21,Fin her place.
OL,26,@qD@AOUrD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to hold cross-party talks on
OL,4,Cfixing crisis in adult social care
OL,6,FA party source criticised the short
OL,7,Fnotice invite, suggesting: "It's
OL,8,Falmost like it's only being done for
OL,9,Fshow."
OL,11,FMr Andrew said his party is "ready to
OL,12,Fwork with Labour on measures that
OL,13,Fimprove social care provided they are
OL,14,Fnot reliant on yet more tax rises and
OL,15,Fborrowing".
OL,17,FLib Dem leader Sir Ed Davey will join
OL,18,Fthe meeting via Zoom on Wednesday.
OL,19,FWriting on X, he said he is currently
OL,20,Fin France with his family and unable
OL,21,Fto be in Westminster.
OL,26,@oD@\OUqD@FO]sD@]OUwD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to hold cross-party talks on
OL,4,Cfixing crisis in adult social care
OL,6,F"I'm hopeful this call may prove to be
OL,7,Fthe first step towards fixing our
OL,8,Fbroken care service," he added.
OL,10,FMr Farage criticised the Prime
OL,11,FMinister for not extending an invite
OL,12,Fto his party, which "led over 300
OL,13,Fnational opinion polls and represents
OL,14,Fthousands of councillors and millions
OL,15,Fof Britons across the country".
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@UO]tD@UOUwD@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to hold cross-party talks on
OL,4,Cfixing crisis in adult social care
OL,6,FHe claimed it is "uniparty in action",
OL,7,Fadding: "It's now clear that Burnham
OL,8,Fis conspiring behind closed doors with
OL,9,Fthe failed political establishment to
OL,10,Ffoist further tax rises on the
OL,11,Fcountry."
OL,13,FMeanwhile, Green Party leader Zack
OL,14,FPolanski said inviting opposition
OL,15,Fleaders to talk is "positive".
OL,17,FHe told the BBC's Newsnight: "I would
OL,18,Flike to be there. Of course, I would,
OL,19,Fand I'd encourage the Prime Minister
OL,20,Fto extend that invitation.
OL,26,@nD@ROUnD@eO]oD@IOUsD@IO]wD@TOUwD@]O]yD@
OL,26,A^OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to hold cross-party talks on
OL,4,Cfixing crisis in adult social care
OL,6,F"I think the point here, though, is
OL,7,Fnot politicians' personal egos. The
OL,8,Fpoint is, adult social care is a
OL,9,Fticking time bomb."
OL,11,FMr Burnham has repeatedly vowed to
OL,12,Fexpend "whatever political capital I
OL,13,Fhave" on fixing the system, warning
OL,14,Fthe NHS "will collapse" otherwise.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@SO]tD@HOUuD@EO]vD@IOUvD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to hold cross-party talks on
OL,4,Cfixing crisis in adult social care
OL,6,FAhead of his speech in London on
OL,7,FWednesday, he insisted the time for
OL,8,F"playing politics" on the issue is
OL,9,Fover, "when the human cost of that
OL,10,Fmeans carers struggling, families
OL,11,Fpaying the price and our NHS buckling
OL,12,Funder the strain".
OL,14,FHe said: "Last week I said we needed a
OL,15,Fdifferent kind of politics: problem-
OL,16,Fsolving, not point-scoring. Nowhere is
OL,17,Fthat more urgent than social care.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@RO]qD@GOUtD@QO]vD@JOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to hold cross-party talks on
OL,4,Cfixing crisis in adult social care
OL,6,F"For decades, governments have kicked
OL,7,Fthis issue down the road because
OL,8,Fthey've seen it as too risky, too
OL,9,Fdifficult, and too complicated.
OL,11,F"Politicians might have different
OL,12,Fviews, but I'm serious about fixing
OL,13,Fthis issue and to do that, we have to
OL,14,Ffind common ground and listen to
OL,15,Fothers to find a way forward."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUwD@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to hold cross-party talks on
OL,4,Cfixing crisis in adult social care
OL,6,FHe said reform of the sector "comes
OL,7,Fdown to a choice", adding: "We can
OL,8,Fcarry on passing the problem to the
OL,9,Fnext generation, or we can face it
OL,10,Fhead-on and work together to build a
OL,11,Fcare system that gives people dignity,
OL,12,Fsecurity and the support they deserve.
OL,14,F"This is about bringing back hope that
OL,15,Fwe can finally fix the difficult
OL,16,Fissues that have been ignored for too
OL,17,Flong, and making Britain believe again.
OL,19,F"That's why I'm making this choice and
OL,20,FI'm prepared to put everything I've
OL,21,Fgot behind it."
OL,26,@nD@^OUoD@QO]oD@\OUvD@AOU{D@AOU}D@OO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to hold cross-party talks on
OL,4,Cfixing crisis in adult social care
OL,6,FIt comes after the Government said
OL,7,Fthere are "no plans" for a so-called
OL,8,F"death tax" after reports Mr Burnham
OL,9,Fmight seek to put forward plans he had
OL,10,Fpreviously put forward while he was
OL,11,Fhealth secretary in 2010.
OL,13,FAs part of the then-Labour government
OL,14,Funder Gordon Brown, Mr Burnham had
OL,15,Fsuggested a levy to pay a proposed
OL,16,Fnational care service could take 10%
OL,17,Foff people's estates after they died.
OL,19,FBut the plans were scuppered by the
OL,20,FConservatives, who at the time accused
OL,21,FLabour of levying a "death tax".
OL,26,@oD@KOUoD@TO]pD@AOUpD@KO]}D@UOU}D@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30211
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to hold cross-party talks on
OL,4,Cfixing crisis in adult social care
OL,6,FThe compulsory levy was one of a range
OL,7,Fof options for paying for social care
OL,8,Fpresented by Mr Burnham more than a
OL,9,Fdecade ago, with alternatives
OL,10,Fincluding increased state funding out
OL,11,Fof general taxation and a voluntary
OL,12,Fcontribution.
OL,14,FMr Burnham has frequently cited his
OL,15,Fpersonal experience of the care
OL,16,Fsystem, as his father lives with
OL,17,FAlzheimer's in a care home.
OL,19,FHe has described as "not defensible" a
OL,20,Fsystem that can see people lose their
OL,21,Fhomes and savings to pay for care.
OL,26,@{D@UOU{D@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30212
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to hold cross-party talks on
OL,4,Cfixing crisis in adult social care
OL,6,FHe will also visit a care home on
OL,7,FWednesday, alongside Baroness Louise
OL,8,FCasey, who is currently leading a
OL,9,Fcommission into social care.
OL,11,FThere, she is expected to announce her
OL,12,Fso-called "Big Conversation on Care",
OL,13,Fseeking public opinion on what a
OL,14,Fsocial care system should look like,
OL,15,Fwhat people should pay and what role
OL,16,Fthe state should play to inform her
OL,17,Fmajor review.
OL,26,@tD@KOUtD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30213
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to hold cross-party talks on
OL,4,Cfixing crisis in adult social care
OL,6,FLady Casey, who is expected to publish
OL,7,Fher first report from her review later
OL,8,Fthis year, noted in a speech earlier
OL,9,Fthis month that there have been no
OL,10,Ffewer than 22 attempts since 1997 at
OL,11,Freforming the sector ` none of which
OL,12,Fshe said had "fixed the foundations".
OL,14,FAhead of the care home visit, she said
OL,15,Fthere is a need for an "honest
OL,16,Fconversation about how to build
OL,17,Fsomething better" than the current
OL,18,Fsystem, which she has previously
OL,19,Fdescribed as "patched together".
OL,26,@tD@NOUtD@dO]wD@XOUyD@QO]{D@NOU{D@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30214
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to hold cross-party talks on
OL,4,Cfixing crisis in adult social care
OL,6,FShe said: "For too long, we have been
OL,7,Fstuck in the same cycle: crisis,
OL,8,Fpromises of reform, another review and
OL,9,Fthen retreat, while the people who
OL,10,Fneed care, and their families, bear
OL,11,Fthe brunt.
OL,13,F"Fixing adult social care is about far
OL,14,Fmore than money. People are already
OL,15,Fpaying for failure through council
OL,16,Ftax, pressure on the NHS, their
OL,17,Fsavings, giving up work and the forced
OL,18,Fsale of their homes.
OL,26,@nD@KOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30215
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to hold cross-party talks on
OL,4,Cfixing crisis in adult social care
OL,6,F"The choice is whether we keep putting
OL,7,Fmoney into a system that is unfair,
OL,8,Funpredictable and broken, or have an
OL,9,Fhonest conversation about how to build
OL,10,Fsomething better.
OL,12,F"That is why we need a public
OL,13,Fconversation on care that tackles the
OL,14,Ftough questions. It's only by facing
OL,15,Fup to this problem together that we
OL,16,Fcan fix social care once and for all."
OL,18,FWhile Lady Casey's final report was
OL,19,Fgiven a deadline of publication by
OL,20,F2028, she has previously indicated the
OL,21,Foverall work might be completed sooner.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUxD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30216
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to hold cross-party talks on
OL,4,Cfixing crisis in adult social care
OL,6,FCaroline Abrahams, charity director at
OL,7,FAge UK, said the current system "came
OL,8,Finto being after the Second World War
OL,9,Fand is no longer fit for purpose, so
OL,10,Fit needs a fundamental rethink".
OL,12,FShe said funding for reforms is likely
OL,13,Fto be "one of the thorniest questions
OL,14,Fof all", adding: "The chances are that
OL,15,Fwe will all have to put our hands in
OL,16,Four pockets.
OL,18,F"However, this doesn't necessarily
OL,19,Fmean we will pay more, just that we
OL,20,Fwill pay differently."
OL,26,@oD@aOUrD@_O]uD@GOUvD@GO]vD@ROUzD@AOU|D@
OL,26,AVO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30217
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to hold cross-party talks on
OL,4,Cfixing crisis in adult social care
OL,6,FSarah Woolnough, chief executive at
OL,7,FThe King's Fund, welcomed engagement
OL,8,Fwith the public but said "the
OL,9,Ffloodgates to questions about how any
OL,10,Ftype of reform will be funded" have
OL,11,Fbeen opened.
OL,13,FShe added: "One in three believe,
OL,14,Fwrongly, that social care services are
OL,15,Fgenerally free at the point of need.
OL,16,FThe Government must show the public
OL,17,Fwhat they stand to gain and first win
OL,18,Fthe argument for the need for reform
OL,19,Fbefore talking about how to fund it."
OL,26,@pD@ZOUrD@^O]uD@LOU{D@eO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30218
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to hold cross-party talks on
OL,4,Cfixing crisis in adult social care
OL,6,FThe Centre for Ageing Better's State
OL,7,Fof Ageing report last year stated
OL,8,Fprojections that 26% of the population
OL,9,Fin England will be aged 65 and over
OL,10,Fand 46% will be aged 50 and over by
OL,11,F2065, while the number of people aged
OL,12,F65 and over in England is projected to
OL,13,Fincrease by 3.3 million in the next 20
OL,14,Fyears and by 6.5 million in the next
OL,15,F40 years.
OL,17,FHugh Alderwick, director of policy and
OL,18,Fresearch at the Health Foundation,
OL,19,Falso welcomed Mr Burnham's commitment,
OL,20,Fand called for "sustained political
OL,21,Fwill and investment to make it happen".
OL,26,@|D@POU}D@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G18/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30219
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
