OL,3,CBurnham to hold cross-party talks on
OL,4,Cfixing crisis in adult social care
OL,6,FThe Royal College of Nursing said all
OL,7,Fpolitical parties "must feel a moral
OL,8,Fresponsibility to get behind this
OL,9,Fafter successive governments have
OL,10,Ffailed".
OL,12,FNicola Ranger, general secretary and
OL,13,Fchief executive, said: "A new model
OL,14,Fwith registered nurse-led care at its
OL,15,Fcore will be transformative in
OL,16,Fdelivering high-quality, person-
OL,17,Fcentred treatment and support, while
OL,18,Freducing the pressure on the NHS."
